# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC: github.com/victoriacity/scramble. Nothing holding a
# credential may be tracked, and the gate scans tracked files for secret-shaped
# strings on every run.
#
# The line below used to say this repo had no remote and that tokens should be
# rotated if one were ever added. One was added, and the line stayed.
.scramble/slack.json
slack-app-credentials.json
slack-auth-ticket.txt
.config/
.scramble/cursor.json
.scramble/status.json
.scramble/last-live-smoke.json

# A key handed to an agent lands here, and this repo is public.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.example.env
rewrite.env

# THE AGENT'S OWN WORKING STATE STAYS OFF THE PUBLIC REPO. Both directories hold how THIS
# host runs the tool: harness reproducers, gate config, hook scripts, room logs
# and the local persona. The files stay on disk for the agents that use them and
# leave the published history.
.akari/
.scramble/
